# Do not damage BEAVIS2 or the phil account

Operator hard rule (Phil, 2026-08-21): **Do not damage BEAVIS2 or the phil account.**

This rule **does not weaken**
[`beavis2-lab-hard-rules.mdc`](beavis2-lab-hard-rules.mdc) (rotation
identities, SoftHSM, never rotate `phil`) or
[`host-session-safety.mdc`](host-session-safety.mdc) (no surprise reboot,
startup wipe, or desktop-session damage). It adds a ship/QA ban: the
lab **host** is not a disposable enclave image.

## The rule

> **Beavis2 is the operator console and AIC Server host. `phil` stays in
> local Administrators. Never rotate, rename, disable, or remove `phil`.
> Never treat the host Agent or host desktop as a throwaway enclave
> seat. Shipping scripts, cookbooks, or “make the kit reachable” is not
> permission to reset the lab, kill services, or uninstall the host
> Agent.**

## Forbidden without explicit same-message consent

- Destructive lab reset (`db-init --confirm`, `Restore-Beavis2Lab.ps1`
  except when the operator named that restore, `seed-dev --reset`)
- Stopping or recycling `aic-server-service` / `aic-offline-agent-service`
  “to ship scripts” or “to prove the kit”
- Host Agent uninstall / `-Uninstall` / service delete on Beavis2
- `Deploy-OfflineAgentDev.ps1` against the operator daily desktop as if
  it were an enclave image
- Password rotation, group membership, or `--force` rotate against `phil`
- Public-demo terraform / `deploy/azure/deploy.sh` / cargo clean

## Required

- Rotation / elevation lab identities remain **`liebsoft`** and **`lanicu`**
  only ([`beavis2-lab-hard-rules.mdc`](beavis2-lab-hard-rules.mdc)).
- Prefer leaving `aic-server-service` Running.
- Enclave seats are Docker / Hyper-V / customer VMs — **not** Beavis2.

## Worked violation → fix

**Violation:** An agent uninstalls `aic-offline-agent-service` on Beavis2
to “test the CMMC seed script,” or runs `db-init` so a cookbook looks
clean.

**Fix:** Document and stage scripts only. Run `-?` / parse / required-list
grep. Live Agent QA stays on a **named seat**, never the host.

## Origin

2026-08-21 — operator: do not damage BEAVIS2 or the phil account while
shipping enclave/agent scripts.
